{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119894","id":3773361826,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7g6O6i","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119894","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119894.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119894.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119894","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119894/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119894/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119894/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e5dac1fd3631d98d90c1344068c7dca7f4275b72","number":119894,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add author disclosure to PR template (incentivizing AI usage disclosure)","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe current PR template asks for disclosing AI, but is so lenient about it that at least half of the obviously-AI PRs from the last month or so don’t even bother mentioning it.\r\n\r\nIt is important for reviewers to know when AI is used or not, and if it was used: to what extent. Not being sure comes to the detriment of first time reviewers as half the time of a reviewer is spent on investigating the PR and author to determine AI usage. This is increasingly demotivating to reviewers. PRs that do not disclose the use of generative AI waste reviewer time with code that makes no sense. Code added by an agent that doesn’t care, can’t take responsibility for it, or can’t continue to maintain it, should not be added to the codebase. It is important for the health of Godot that human made contributions can be reviewed with the attention they deserve. AI use disclose, or non-use disclosure, is part of the solution. This PR makes it more explicit.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nPlease do suggest any improvements you can think of.\r\n\r\n## Author disclosure\r\n\r\nNo generative AI was used to make this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","descript